iew” jurisdiction</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2007/15/section/16">16.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2007/15/section/16">Application for relief under section 15(1)</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2007/15/section/17">17.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2007/15/section/17">Quashing orders under section 15(1): supplementary provision</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2007/15/section/18">18.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2007/15/section/18">Limits of jurisdiction under section 15(1)</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2007/15/section/19">19.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2007/15/section/19">Transfer of judicial review applications from High Court</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2007/15/section/20">20.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2007/15/section/20">Transfer of judicial review applications from the Court of Session</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2007/15/section/20A">20A.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2007/15/section/20A">Procedural steps where application transferred</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2007/15/sect